Package: planarsviz
Title: Visualizations for Planar Constituency Analyses
Version: 0.3.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Jeff", "Good", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "jcgood@buffalo.edu")
Author: Jeff Good [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Jeff Good <jcgood@buffalo.edu>
Description:
    Data-driven charts for planar constituency and laminar-family analyses:
    pooled test plots, boundary frequencies, laminar forests and overlays,
    representative trees, conflict groups, tree counts and boundary
    strength. Analysis stays in Python; the package reads a data bundle
    exported by scripts/analysis/export_planarsviz_data.py and returns plot
    objects. See README.md, docs/planarsviz_guide.md and
    docs/planarsviz_charts.md.
